      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Famous Broadway tunes sung by a stunning cast of stars! Great Big-Band arrangements with lots of brass and sax!"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Famous Broadway tunes sung by a stunning cast of stars! Great Big-Band arrangements with lots of brass and sax!\n\nSINGLE TICKET PRICES\nAdult Singles: Nov or Dec Concerts $40 or $30, April Concert $30\nStudent Singles: Nov or Dec Concerts $20 \u0003(high school, college, university: proof of ID)\nChildren and Elementary Students may attend all concerts for"
      }
