      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "March Break MAMBO –\n“Presto, Mambo” with the Platypus Theatre\n\nEnd your March Break with lots of heat! Platypus Theatre and the BSO brings you a hot show with music and an interactive theatre adventure from Latin America cultures. With budget-friendly ticket prices, the whole house can get out and"
      }
